<div class="announcement">TRENDING TECH, HANDPICKED FOR EVERYDAY LIFE</div>
<header class="site-header">
  <nav aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="#shop">Shop tech</a><a href="#story">Why Scottney</a><a href="#journal">The signal</a></nav>
  <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" aria-label="{{ shop.name }} home"><img class="logo" src="{{ 'scottney-logo.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ shop.name }}"></a>
  <div class="header-actions"><a class="icon-link" href="{{ routes.search_url }}" aria-label="Search">Search</a><a class="icon-link" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" aria-label="Shopping bag">Bag ({{ cart.item_count }})</a></div>
</header>

<section class="hero-banner" aria-label="Error 404 storefront"><img src="{{ 'error-404-banner.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Error 404 neon retro electronics storefront at sunset"></section>

<section id="top" class="hero-grid">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <span class="eyebrow">The everyday tech edit</span>
    <div><h1>Error 404: <em>Boring Gadgets Not Found.</em></h1><p>Trending electronics and smart accessories, handpicked by Scottney &amp; Co. to make everyday life easier. Because struggling with basic tasks is very 404.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#shop">Shop what&apos;s new <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#story">Our point of view</a></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-image"><span class="badge">Staff favorite</span><img src="{{ 'error-404-portrait.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Error 404 neon retro electronics shopfront"></div>
</section>

<section id="shop" class="product-section">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-label">The edit</span><h2>What&apos;s moving now</h2><p>The pieces people are saving, sharing, and adding to cart right now.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">View all ↗</a></div>
  <div class="products">
    {% for product in collections.all.products limit: 8 %}
      <article class="product-card">
        <a href="{{ product.url }}" aria-label="View {{ product.title }}"><div class="product-image">{% if forloop.index <= 2 %}<span class="badge">Trending</span>{% endif %}{% if product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}</div></a>
        <div class="product-meta"><div><h3>{{ product.title }}</h3><p>{{ product.description | strip_html | truncate: 90 }}</p><p>✓ Ready to ship</p></div><p class="product-price">{{ product.price | money }}</p></div>
      </article>
    {% else %}<p>No products found yet. Add products in Shopify to populate this edit.</p>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="shop-note">Live catalog from Shopify</p>
</section>

<section id="story" class="story"><div class="story-inner"><span class="section-label">Why Scottney &amp; Co.</span><div><h2>Better tech should disappear into the way you live.</h2><p>We cut through the noise to find useful, well-designed electronics that earn their place on your desk, in your bag, and at home.</p></div></div></section>
<footer id="journal" class="site-footer"><img src="{{ 'scottney-logo.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ shop.name }}"><div class="footer-links"><a href="#shop">Shop</a><a href="#story">About</a><a href="{{ routes.contact_url }}">Contact</a></div><p>© {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} {{ shop.name }}. All signal, no noise.</p></footer>
